          ],
          "question": {
            "text": "Two resistance $\\mathrm{X}$ and $\\mathrm{Y}$ are connected in the two gaps of a meterbridge and the null points is obtained at $20 \\mathrm{~cm}$ from zero end. When the resistance of $20 \\Omega$ is connected in series with the smaller of the two resistance $\\mathrm{X}$ and $\\mathrm{Y}$, the null point shifts to $40 \\mathrm{~cm}$ from left end. The value of smaller resistance in ohm is",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "wY71m",
              "text": "$6$",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "nSXh3",
              "text": "$9$",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "3W2vi",
              "text": "$12$",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": true
            },
            {
              "id": "pGvwM",
              "text": "$15$",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "For a meterbridge, $\\frac{\\mathrm{X}}{\\mathrm{Y}}=\\frac{l}{100-l}$\nIn the first case, $l=20 \\mathrm{~cm}$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{\\mathrm{X}}{\\mathrm{Y}} & =\\frac{20}{100-20}=\\frac{20}{80}=\\frac{1}{4} \\\\\n\\therefore \\quad 4 \\mathrm{X} & =\\mathrm{Y}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the second case, $l^{\\prime}=40 \\mathrm{~cm}$\n$$\n\\begin{array}{ll}\n\\therefore & \\frac{\\mathrm{X}^{\\prime}}{\\mathrm{Y}^{\\prime}}=\\frac{40}{100-40}= \\\\\n& \\text { But, } \\mathrm{X}^{\\prime}=\\mathrm{X}+2 \\\\\n\\therefore \\quad & \\frac{\\mathrm{X}+20}{\\mathrm{Y}}=\\frac{2}{3} \\\\\n\\therefore \\quad & \\frac{\\mathrm{X}+20}{4 \\mathrm{X}}=\\frac{2}{3} \\\\\n\\therefore \\quad & 8 \\mathrm{X}=3 \\mathrm{X}+60 \\\\\n\\therefore \\quad & \\mathrm{X}=12 \\Omega\n\\end{array}\n$$",
            "image": null
          },
          "videoSolution": null,
          "syllabusCategory": "noChange",
