          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "At null condition, $\\frac{\\mathrm{R}_1}{\\mathrm{R}_2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{X}}{100-\\mathrm{X}}$\nThis condition is independent of the crosssectional area of the wire used.\n$\\therefore \\quad$ The null point will remain the same. (i.e., $l \\mathrm{~cm}$ from left end)",
