          "question": {
            "text": "With a resistance of ‘X’ in the left gap and a resistance of 9 <math><mi>Ω</mi></math> in the right gap of meter bridge, the balance point is obtained at 40 cm from the left end. In what way and to which resistance <math><mn>3</mn><mi>Ω</mi></math> resistance be connected to obtained the balance at 50 cm from the left end?",
