              "id": "ytxY0",
              "text": "In series with <math><mn>9</mn><mi>Ω</mi></math>",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "bdNwT",
              "text": "Parallel to <math><mi>X</mi><mi>Ω</mi></math>",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "FomJt",
              "text": "In series with <math><mi>X</mi><mi></mi><mi>Ω</mi></math>",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Xr6Or",
              "text": "Parallel to <math><mn>9</mn><mi></mi><mi>Ω</mi></math>",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "The balance condition of bridge is shown below in the first case <br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/mht_cet/4d447c70-0ceb-491c-850e-d68f5b05e118.png\"> <br/>Then, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>Ω</mi></math>  <br/>To get the balance point at 50 cm from left end, the balanced, condition becomes, <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>'</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>'</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>Ω</mi></math>  <br/>As, in series combinations resistances are added, so to get <math><mn>9</mn><mi>Ω</mi></math> at left gap the <math><mn>3</mn><mi>Ω</mi></math> resistance should be added in series with <math><mi>X</mi><mi>Ω</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>Ω</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> .",
            "image": null
          },
